OL,3,GNEWSAFour Lincolnshire Police stations
OL,4,Acould close
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight police front desk counters will
OL,7,Fshut because they are "underused", with
OL,8,Fa review also under way into the future
OL,9,Fof four stations.
OL,11,FLincolnshire Police said it would
OL,12,Fpermanently close town enquiry offices
OL,13,F(TEOs) in Sleaford, Stamford, Bourne,
OL,14,FHolbeach, Market Rasen, Mablethorpe,
OL,15,FHorncastle and Birchwood in Lincoln.
OL,17,FThe stations under review are Stamford,
OL,18,FBourne, Birchwood and Mablethorpe.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
