OL,3,GNEWSAFour Lincolnshire Police stations
OL,4,Acould close
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant chief constable Kate Anderson
OL,7,Fsaid the TEO decision aimed to ensure
OL,8,Fpolice resources were "focused" where
OL,9,Fthey would deliver the "greatest
OL,10,Fbenefit" to people.
